Lua 5.5.1 (https://www.lua.org) used by the board model of the POSIX simulator
(cpu/posix/host/board.c, simulator option --board). Sources are not modified:
files of the tag v5.5.1 of the official repository https://github.com/lua/lua
without the stand-alone interpreter (lua.c) and test files (ltests.c,
ltests.h, onelua.c). The sources are compiled for the host (CSRC_HOST_LIB).

